📋 MY Bharat Regional CSR Linked Green Skills & Tribal Empowerment Network

This project is a working prototype developed under the vision of Viksit Bharat @2047. It aims to connect youth and the Baiga Tribe in mining districts such as Balaghat, Madhya Pradesh, with local industries (MOIL/HCL), modern technology (GIS/AI), and environmental conservation.

💡 Key Features

* Geo-Tagged Plantation: When a student plants a sapling, its GPS data will be recorded automatically when they take a photograph using their phone.
* GIS and Satellite Tracking: With the help of ISRO Bhuvan/satellite technology, the growth of the plants and the greenery of the area will be tracked every six months.
* AI Smart Verification: The uploaded photographs will be automatically verified by AI, and Green Credit Points will be credited to the student's wallet.
* Baiga Skill Hub: Baiga experts will be trained as Master Trainers to teach college youth how to make eco-friendly furniture from bamboo and paddy straw, as well as how to produce organic compost.

